DTSTAMP:20260426T035105Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T092700
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T153300
SUMMARY:Angel Island Hike  (Leave on Tiburon Ferry at 10:00)
DESCRIPTION:Mindfull Hikes\n**\\*\\*\\* 4/19/2026 Hike is full and RSVPs a
 re closed \\*\\*\\***\nThis hike is for members who have attended two or m
 ore hikes in the last three months and buy a ferry ticket. Everyone will s
 tart off on the waitlist. ***When you buy your ticket let me know and I'll
  move you to 'going'.*** Group size is limited to 10.\n\n***Please be in g
 ood enough shape to hike at a moderate/fast steady pace (+/-2.5 mph) and c
 omfortable with elevation changes.***\n\n**Distance:** +/- 6.2 miles total
 \n**The hike:** Venturing out from our usual hiking places to have a littl
 e fun. A loop hike along north ridge trail\, ida trail\, fire road and sun
 set trail. Exquisite views along the way from multiple perspectives.\n\nWe
 'll take the 10:00 AM ferry from Tiburon to Angel Island\, hike and return
  on the 2:20 or 3:20 PM ferry from Angel Island to Tiburon.\n\n**Where to 
 Meet:** Caffè Acri in Tiburon at 9:27 AM\n\n**Link to buy your ferry tick
 et:** https://angelislandferry.com/schedule/\n\n**What to bring:** Lunch\,
  water\, hat\, good hiking shoes\, a joyful spirit and laughter. Please dr
 ess appropriately for the weather that day. Layers of clothing are always 
 advisable.\n**===================================**\n**Reminders:**\nMindf
 ul hikes are intended to be a way to connect more fully with ourselves\, e
 ach other and with the land. There will be two periods of silent walking t
 hroughout the hike to allow the senses to be fully alive and felt. There w
 ill also be time during the hike to visit and connect with each other. The
 se times of talking and connecting are an invitation to bring mindfulness 
 to the present moment. **It's a time to put away the cell phone and camera
 s to disengage from technology to be fully present with each other\, our *
 senses and the land we are inhabiting.***\n\n**Dāna**\nIn the spirit of t
 he Buddhist tradition mindful hikes are offered as a dāna based event. Ri
 ck Hansen says “generosity is a beautiful practice that opens and gladde
 ns the heart\, relaxes the contraction of ‘self’ and ripples out into 
 the world to touch many people.” The dāna practice is **heart centered*
 * and in the spirit of generosity. Venmo or cash is graciously accepted. V
 enmo account is: @vickieix8\; last four digits 4714 of my phone # if asked
 .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-ohazunav/events/31161518
 7/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20251019T211239Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251019T211239Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
