 aphies\, and offers note-taking\, outlining\, and paper-writing features\,
  including the capability to create papers via GoogleDocs.&#160\;  This No
 odleTools workshop will focus on the MLA citation style\, which is typical
 ly used in the English\, ESL\, Humanities\, Philosophy\, and Religion disc
 iplines.&#160\;For more information and to register\, visit their website 
 here! (https://santarosa.libcal.com/event/16679272)
